				58,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Echo): Add telemetry event for scheduler startup\n\nIntroduce telemetry capture for `land:echo:scheduler:start` within `SchedulerBuilder::Build` to track worker pool initialization. This requires adding the `Common` crate as a dependency in `Cargo.toml` to access the `Telemetry::CaptureEvent` function.\n\nThis change enables the Boot dashboard to monitor the active worker-pool size across processes utilizing Echo (e.g., Mountain), providing visibility into resource allocation at runtime. The telemetry event is emitted only when the `Capture` flag is enabled, remaining a no-op in release builds.",
			"SHA": "edbe51d51406f1177a14d6db3612c88b4dd3f47a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-03T07:02:00Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				58,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Echo): Standardize CHANGELOG formatting and whitespace\n\nRefactor the CHANGELOG.md file to remove legacy line-break artifacts and ensure consistent line wrapping across all version history entries. The diff shows a reformatting of the entire document to align with standard markdown presentation while preserving the narrative of Echo's evolution from a Cloudflare Workers scaffold to the high-performance Rust work-stealing scheduler.\n\nThis cleanup ensures the documentation remains readable and consistent with the project's strict formatting standards, facilitating better maintainability as the version history grows.",
			"SHA": "d560fb4b82e2081385fef5a7eb12b44caaba012a"
		},
